{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52151","headline":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 七 · 许敬宗","name":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尊师上德，齿学崇年。\n登歌畅美，啐爵思虔。\n雩童鼓箧，硕老重筵。\n辞雕辩囿，矢激言泉。\n（其七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}